Let's validate that all values in column `a` have a string length between 2 and 10
characters.

::: {#8a22599a .cell execution_count=3}
``` {.python .cell-code}
validation = (
    pb.Validate(data=tbl)
    .col_vals_str_len(columns="a", min_val=2, max_val=10)
    .interrogate()
)

validation
```

